>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Eternally_Bound\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eternally_Bound_(Condition)\" title=\"Eternally Bound (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eternally Bound\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Eternally Bound</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cazador will not let this spawn die - it is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li>\n<li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Ketheric_Thorm)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Ketheric Thorm) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Ketheric_Thorm)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Ketheric Thorm) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Ketheric is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> against all damage while he has the Nightsong imprisoned.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Shadow_Visage\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Visage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Visage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Visage (Condition)\">Shadow Visage</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This visage is floating in shadowy limbo. It cannot be damaged until drawn into combat.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Silvered_Bulwark\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silvered_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvered Bulwark (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silvered Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Silvered_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvered Bulwark (Condition)\">Silvered Bulwark</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage. This protection is shared by every creature and object within the barrier.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Immune to all damage</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202449\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4484/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60535/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15244/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 7/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.049/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1347238/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTranscl